  s5: Act: outputs written, event not yet
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an agent reads, is refused, or gives a bad argument
  s0 --> s2: an agent runs an act that runs Probes
  s1 --> s4: hyp records what it will print, in the clone's trace folder
  s2 --> s3: the Probes end#59; hyp hashes their outputs
  s3 --> s1: a guard checked again refuses#59; nothing is written
  s3 --> s5: every guard holds#59; hyp writes the outputs
  s4 --> s0: hyp prints to the agent
  s5 --> s1: hyp appends the act's event
  s5 --> s0: hyp crashes before the event
